    "title": "New UAW contract landed for north Toledo plant - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Toledo\nNew UAW contract landed for north Toledo plant\n5 hours ago\nTOLEDO, Ohio — UAW Local 14 has finalized a new four-year contract with General Motors, securing $200 million in investment for GM’s propulsion plant in North Toledo. Local 14 President Tony Totty said the deal wasn’t handed to them—it was hard-fought and skillfully negotiated, thanks in large part to veteran negotiator Jeff King. With more than 40 years of experience, King helped the union win all 400 of its contract requests.\n2",
